{"seq":2,"slug":"comparative-literature","title":"比较文学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"比较文学-简介\">比较文学 简介</h1><p>比较文学以跨语言、跨文化、跨学科的视野审视文学现象，是人文研究中最具国际视野的学科之一。研究生阶段的比较文学学习不仅要求掌握比较研究的方法论，更需要在具体的文本分析中培养跨文化对话的能力和全球性文学想象力。</p>\n<p>本课程设置四个章节，循序渐进地展开比较文学的核心议题。第一章<strong>比较文学基础</strong>系统介绍影响研究与接受研究、平行研究以及跨学科比较这三大方法论取向，为后续专题研究奠定概念工具。第二章<strong>东西方文学比较</strong>将视角聚焦于中西叙事传统的异同、翻译研究的理论与实践以及世界文学概念的演变，深入探讨文学在跨文化旅行中的变形与再生。第三章<strong>文体与类型比较</strong>以诗学、小说和戏剧三种主要文学体裁为轴线，考察不同文化传统中文类的形成、交叉与互渗。第四章<strong>当代比较文学前沿</strong>关注生态批评、创伤文学和迁移文学等新兴研究领域，呈现全球化时代比较文学的最新问题意识。</p>\n<p>建议学习者在阅读时始终保持双重意识：既关注具体文本的审美独特性，又追问比较行为本身的前提与限度。适当阅读原语文本或可靠译本将极大丰富比较分析的深度。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"比较文学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-reception-studies","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 影响研究与接受研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/foundations/influence-reception-studies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"parallel-studies","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 平行研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/foundations/parallel-studies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"interdisciplinary-comparison","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 跨学科比较","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/foundations/interdisciplinary-comparison"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"east-west","title":"东西方文学比较","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/east-west","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chinese-western-narrative","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 中西叙事传统比较","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/east-west/chinese-western-narrative"},{"seq":2,"slug":"translation-studies","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 翻译研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/east-west/translation-studies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"world-literature-concept","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 世界文学概念","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/east-west/world-literature-concept"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"genre-studies","title":"文体与类型比较","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/genre-studies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"comparative-poetics","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 比较诗学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/genre-studies/comparative-poetics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"novel-across-cultures","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 跨文化小说研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/genre-studies/novel-across-cultures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"drama-comparison","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 戏剧比较研究","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/genre-studies/drama-comparison"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary","title":"当代比较文学前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/contemporary","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eco-criticism","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 生态批评","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/contemporary/eco-criticism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"trauma-literature","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 创伤文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/contemporary/trauma-literature"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-literature","title":"研究生 比较文学 — 迁移文学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/literature/comparative-literature/contemporary/migration-literature"}]}]}